	•	Section 3 Comments/Quotes: The paper states that “a multivariate long short-term memory algorithm was applied to forecast subsequent TTLs,” and Figure 2 shows a “multivariate 3-step” LSTM. The input data were tabular clinical variables from routine care. SHAP was used to identify influential features and guide input selection. Within the 117-case study cohort, 80%, 10%, and 10% were randomly assigned to training, validation, and test datasets. The final model did not use an explicit comparator model; rather, different input combinations were compared by MSE. Explicit hyperparameter tuning was not reported in the retrieved text.  ￼

