	•	Section 4 Comments/Quotes: The first 117 cases were split into training dataset n=93, validation dataset n=12, and test dataset n=12, as shown in Figure 1. Data preprocessing was described in detail: intravenous dose was multiplied by 6, all clinical data were standardized using Z-score normalization, and missing prior time points for the 3-step LSTM were filled with cohort mean values plus an imputation flag. Class imbalance is not applicable because this is a regression/forecasting task rather than class prediction. Code availability was not reported.  ￼

